 opt l
 nam CoCo 2.00.00 FD-500 controller boot source

 opt -c

 use defsfile

 ttl Boot Module
 pag
*******************************************************************
*
*                 Microware Systems Corporation
*
*
*       Os-9 CoCo FD-500 Disk Boot Module
*
*       Software To Boot FD-5xx, DISTO, And J&M Disk Controllers
*
*                         Revised By
